  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Victor, a stranger to see you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Who that? Who that, who that?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AB",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "If I'm not workin' or puttin' work in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm either wheelin' and dealin', or probably jerkin my—",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Listenin' to nuttin', takin' no suggestions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Or destructive criticisms, that can't improve on perfection",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Rock a crowd in sections on a good night, the ho's fight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Always get the dough first then everything else goes right",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "At least that's what they say and who the fuck is they?",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Make a hick say, \"What the hey?\" brought that chick from sick bay",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Ensign, he shoulda asked his upperclassmen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Before he bust blast 'em, never trust no Cardassians",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Captain's log supplemental",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "The Klingons are now aboard the Enterprise rental vessel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "On my cue, photon torpedo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Oh and if I'm not on the block with Jorgito",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "And so on for the street though, smoke a pound of leek though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I'm jokin' on the fact that hip-hop has gone freakshow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Don't let the drama get you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "In the only genre of music where the fans shoot the messenger",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Bitch niggas talk behind your back like a catcher",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Either M-Y-O-B or B-Y-O-stretcher",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "In that order: man, woman, son, daughter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "The beat sound like he's underwater, make it fun to slaughter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Even if you hear some wack shit you never give a chance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Some shit sound like all you could do off it is river-dance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "It's not a hobby, don't be sloppy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Doin' deals with these labels is likened to a botched robbery",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Nobody supposed to get bodied, golly!",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "This shit is like a folly 'bout to cold flip, probably",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "It's not me, he got a ill spills knot in Brooknam",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Where even though kids kill they still chill and look calm",
          "rhyme": "alm",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "While workin' on new developments for the book bomb",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "In one bad experiment, it blew and took a hooker arm (\"Arm and leg\")",
          "rhyme": "uRm",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "BOW! Look mom, no hand",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Studied black magic for years out in no man's land",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "It's like a barbecue, all-swine cookout",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "To fuck up their plans like a blind man lookout",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Cram to overstand it, peep it and absorb it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "The same way he keep all the planets in their proper orbit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Norbit, y'all better off goin' corporate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Nobody wanna hear that bullshit it's too morbid",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "There's no prints, he hold the mic with a mic glove",
          "rhyme": "Ov",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "And rolls dolo from state to state like Ike Love",
          "rhyme": "Ov",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Like on top of the world loose and keep it gully",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Rap creeps seem they got too much juice in their belly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "It's why they brung V he still hungry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "And spit something thick on the mic like a lungy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Mind your daughter, she on line for the water",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "To get lucky like when she find a quarter kinda sorta",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "Remember me god, clean timbs with emery board?",
          "rhyme": "ORd",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "He only came to save the game like a memory card",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "Ooh shrewd, a lot of crews is too rude",
          "rhyme": "yd",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "And it's way too many \"let's not' and \"say we do\" dudes",
          "rhyme": "yd",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "He said 24/7 I be on call",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "He use his vacation days to watch Babylon fall",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "Numbskulls get to steppin', they dumb dull",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "And how he rep the mic is like the weapon from Krull",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "56",
          "text": "Cats be like, \"What's wrong with your man black?\"",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "57",
          "text": "Bio-hazard suit and Van Grack for the anthrax",
          "rhyme": "aks",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "58",
          "text": "Jeez and can't get no peace",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "59",
          "text": "Form blazin' sword for the police robeast",
          "rhyme": "ost",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "60",
          "text": "Cochise, write a rhyme like a book report",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "61",
          "text": "And sell it to a rookie, you could tell by the hook he bought",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "62",
          "text": "You ain't know he sell hooks and choruses?",
          "rhyme": "yz",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "63",
          "text": "They couldn't bang the slang if they looked in thesauruses",
          "rhyme": "yz",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "64",
          "text": "It's like a friendly game of dodge ball",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "65",
          "text": "Oddball god y'all, who played the garage wall",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "66",
          "text": "With the Stan Smith's checkerboard lace",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "67",
          "text": "And the brand new INF, they ain't check the broad waist",
          "rhyme": "ist",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "68",
          "text": "You saw his face? So who next to get they neck chopped",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "69",
          "text": "Or popped like a Beck's top, respect the drop",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "70",
          "text": "It's too much wreck hops, who next to get their neck chopped",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "71",
          "text": "Or popped like a Beck's top? Respect the drop",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "72",
          "text": "Woopdie-do, flow do fifty like a hooptie do",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "73",
          "text": "Groupie crews try to figure out from what coop he flew",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "74",
          "text": "They out of place, beats sounds like outer space",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "75",
          "text": "With no time to waste he was Audi without a trace",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
